<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gold Fields Q2 pre-capex net profit drops.</title>
<headline>Gold Fields Q2 pre-capex net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending 192.34 vs 236.42</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 230.49 vs 205.88</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			24,296  vs 23,448</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	    2,763,000  vs 2,829,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     8.8  vs 8.3</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  41,611  vs 41,593</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     49,411  vs 51,737</p>
<p>Full name: Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
